            %p
              where on the left we used our assumption that
              = succeed "." do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mi d
                      %mo ≠
                      %mn 0
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} d \neq 0
            %p
              We will use this canonical splitting together with the canonical splitting of the even rational cohomology of a cofiber space
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msup
                      %mi S
                      %mrow
                        %mn 2
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                        %mi n
                        %mo +
                        %mi d
                        %mo{:stretchy => "false"} )
                        %mo −
                        %mn 1
                    %mover
                      %mo →
                      %mrow
                        %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                        %mi c
                        %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                    %msup
                      %mi S
                      %mrow
                        %mn 2
                        %mi n
                    %mover
                      %mo →
                      %mrow
                        %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                        %mspace{:width => "thickmathspace"}
                    %msub
                      %mi C
                      %mi c
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} S^{2(n+d)-1} \xrightarrow{ \;c\; } S^{2n} \xrightarrow{ \;\; } C_c
              given by the splitting into degrees
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mn 2
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} (
                    %mi n
                    %mo +
