                      %mi S
                      %mrow
                        %mi n
                        %mo +
                        %mi d
                        %mo −
                        %mn 1
                    %mo{:maxsize => "1.2em", :minsize => "1.2em"} )
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} H_{n-1}Fluxes^E\big( S^{n+d-1} \big)
              is equivalently the class of a homotopy
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/cone"} cone
              with tip
