            %p Now observe that:
            %ol
              %li
                %p
                  by Lemma
                  %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#CofiberECohomologyAsExtensionOfStableCohomotopyByECohomology"}
                  the middle rows of this diagram are
                  = succeed ";" do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/short+exact+sequence"} exact
              %li
                %p
                  the left vertical map is the canonical
                  = succeed "," do
                    %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/injection"} injection
                  %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Chern+character"} Chern character
                  is multiplicative, and in particular respects the unit.
            %p
              By (1) the difference between any two choices of trivializations of the d-invariant (of
              = succeed "-fluxes)" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %msubsup
                        %mi H
                        %mrow
                          %mi n
                          %mo −
                          %mn 1
                        %mi E
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} H^E_{n-1}
              = succeed "-invariants" do
                %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                  %semantics
                    %mrow
                      %mover
                        %mi e
                        %mo ^
                    %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \widehat e
            %p
          %p
            Hence we have a diagrammatic construction of an invariant of
            %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
              %semantics
                %mrow
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} [
                  %mi c
                  %mo{:stretchy => "false"} ]
                %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} [c]
